Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `launch` uses the effect `FS.Read, FS.Write`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effects/service_start_outside_declared_row.jet:6:16
    |
  6 | launch: fn() -[Time]> {
    |                ^^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[Time]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read, FS.Write` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read, FS.Write` to the effect list, or stop using it in `launch`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: launch
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
